{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22445","headline":"初到忠州登东楼寄万州杨八使君 · 白居易","name":"初到忠州登东楼寄万州杨八使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山束邑居窄，峡牵气候偏。\n林峦少平地，雾雨多阴天。\n隐隐煮盐火，漠漠烧畲烟。\n赖此东楼夕，风月时翛然。\n凭轩望所思，目断心涓涓。\n背春有去雁，上水无来船。\n我怀巴东守，本是关西贤。\n平生已不浅，流落重相怜。\n水梗漂万里，笼禽囚五年。\n新恩同雨露，远郡邻山川。\n书信虽往复，封疆徒接连。\n其如美人面，欲见杳无缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22445.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22445","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}